<title>MALAYSIA: Pengkalen Holdings year net still in red.</title>
<headline>Pengkalen Holdings year net still in red.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss		    21.42   vs  loss  55.18</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)  loss 10.8    vs  loss  28.2</p>
<p>    Turnover		   870.37   vs	 871.78</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    35.65   vs  loss  44.40</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less 27.07   vs   add   8.82</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries    less  7.32   vs  less 246.50</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Pengkalen Holdings Bhd is mainly involved in stockbroking, and manufacturing and trading.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
